; math/min and math/max of two integers compare them as integers. As
; doubles, the integers near 2^62 round together (4611686018427387903
; and ...902 are both 4.611686018427388e18), and math/min gave the larger
; of the two.

(pprint (math/min 4611686018427387903 4611686018427387902))
(pprint (math/max -4611686018427387904 -4611686018427387903))
(pprint (math/min -4611686018427387904 4611686018427387903))
(pprint (math/max 7 7))
(list (math/min 1 2) (math/max 1 2))
